{{also|Appendix:Variations of "z"}}
==English==

===Etymology===
[[eye dialect|Eye dialect]] spelling variant of {{m|en|-s}}.

===Suffix===
{{head|en|suffixes}}

# {{lb|en|urban|_|slang|[[lolspeak]]}} {{ngd|Used as a substitute for [[-s]] in marking the plural of nouns. Usually used in words in which the [[-s]] suffix is actually pronounced {{IPAchar|/z/}}.}}
#: {{ux|en|'''Boyz''' are always trouble.}}
# {{lb|en|urban|_|slang}} {{ngd|Used as a substitute for [[-s]] in marking verb inflections.}}
#: {{ux|en|He '''lovez''' me.}}

===See also===
* {{l|en|-a}}

[[Category:English suffixes|z]]

