==Swahili==

===Suffix===
{{head|sw|suffix}}

# {{lb|sw|Sheng}} {{n-g|"[[urbanize]]s" a word, makes it more [[hip]] with [[youth]]}}

===Usage notes===
In Kenya, {{lb|sw|-z}} can be applied to nouns and verbs. In Tanzania, {{lb|sw|-z}} is usually only applied to nouns, like {{l|sw|mtotoz}}.